advancement.silverlighting.silverlighting=silverlighting
advancement.silverlighting.silverlighting.desc=A miracle born from your heart. Still lacking a sturdy blade, but enough to never be separated
advancement.silverlighting.puresilver=puresilver
advancement.silverlighting.puresilver.desc=The former bamboo sword now possesses a true blade name. This new body shall become your sharpest sword

advancement.silverlighting.animasheath=animasheath
advancement.silverlighting.animasheath.desc=Broken, but far from over. Can be easily forged back to its original form
advancement.silverlighting.animasheath_wood=animasheath_wood
advancement.silverlighting.animasheath_wood.desc=A blade with only form. Seems to possess power over wind and detection
advancement.silverlighting.animasheath_stone=animasheath_stone
advancement.silverlighting.animasheath_stone.desc=A blade with only form. Contains uncontrollable destructive power
advancement.silverlighting.animasheath_iron=animasheath_iron
advancement.silverlighting.animasheath_iron.desc=A blade with only form. Becomes sharper through slaughter
advancement.silverlighting.animasheath_gold=animasheath_gold
advancement.silverlighting.animasheath_gold.desc=A blade with only form. Enchantment power is infinitely amplified on the blade
advancement.silverlighting.animasheath_diamond=animasheath_diamond
advancement.silverlighting.animasheath_diamond.desc=A blade with only form. Like awakening from a dream

advancement.silverlighting.animasheath_drape=animasheath_drape
advancement.silverlighting.animasheath_drape.desc=Wind whispers and leaf rustles intertwine. All battles should end before they begin.
advancement.silverlighting.animasheath_spite=animasheath_spite
advancement.silverlighting.animasheath_spite.desc=The world trembles in your hands. Nothing can hinder your steps.
advancement.silverlighting.animasheath_edge=animasheath_edge
advancement.silverlighting.animasheath_edge.desc=Pure killing intent radiates. Your enemies die for being your foes.
advancement.silverlighting.animasheath_gleam=animasheath_gleam
advancement.silverlighting.animasheath_gleam.desc=Brilliant magic patterns surge. This resilience and glory submit to you.
advancement.silverlighting.animasheath_phos=animasheath_phos
advancement.silverlighting.animasheath_phos.desc=Shimmering crystal dust sparkles. Now, face the power you already possess.

advancement.silverlighting.dokkaebisheath=dokkaebisheath
advancement.silverlighting.dokkaebisheath.desc=An extreme point of iaido. Gather all power in an instant§8§l§oBodiless blade, soul as edge

advancement.silverlighting.brokenbamboo=brokenbamboo
advancement.silverlighting.brokenbamboo.desc=Burning bamboo fragments. Pieces that spill when defending with a forged sheath. Can be used as forging material§8§l§oWho calls?
advancement.silverlighting.forgerheart=forgerheart
advancement.silverlighting.forgerheart.desc=The purest substance refined from summarizing blade-forging techniques. Strike it on a blade to witness miracles§8§l§oA great creation of utmost effort
advancement.silverlighting.anticrystal=anticrystal
advancement.silverlighting.anticrystal.desc=You are their master they cannot defy. Whatever you desire, they obey without complaint§4§l§oIf you insist...

advancement.silverlighting.broken_sealedblade=Rusted Blade Shattered
advancement.silverlighting.broken_sealedblade.desc=The already damaged blade breaks again§8§l§oEven you cannot easily repair it
advancement.silverlighting.enchant_simpleblade=Enchantment Faded
advancement.silverlighting.enchant_simpleblade.desc=Your enchantment failed§8§l§oRefrain from such meaningless acts before engraving the blade name
advancement.silverlighting.unenchant_soulsphere=Refinement?
advancement.silverlighting.unenchant_soulsphere.desc=After high-temperature forging, all impurities within the spirit iron are removed§8§l§oLearn from this
advancement.silverlighting.unhundredkill_silverbamboo=Damaged Sheath
advancement.silverlighting.unhundredkill_silverbamboo.desc=Glory and slaughter are not enough to preserve it§8§l§oYou must use it to exorcise a hundred demons

achievement.flammpfeil.slashblade.saheresoulsphere=saheresoulsphere
achievement.flammpfeil.slashblade.saheresoulsphere.desc=A Soul Sphere carrying SA. Strike it on a blade to grant the corresponding SA§8§l§oSpirit iron emitting dazzling radiance
achievement.flammpfeil.slashblade.namedbladeSoul=namedbladeSoul
achievement.flammpfeil.slashblade.namedbladeSoul.desc=Obtained by striking Soul Chips on a burning blade. Records the blade's name. Combine with a nameless sword to give it a new name§8§l§oA crystal entwined with restrained flames
achievement.flammpfeil.slashblade.soulCrystal=soulCrystal
achievement.flammpfeil.slashblade.soulCrystal.desc=Obtained by striking Soul Chips on a burning blade. Fixed cost of 5 levels as repair material§8§l§oCrystal formed from restrained flames
achievement.flammpfeil.slashblade.soulTrapezohedron=soulTrapezohedron
achievement.flammpfeil.slashblade.soulTrapezohedron.desc=Obtained by striking Soul Crystals on a burning blade. A unique crystal containing the blade's will§8§l§oThe key to a spirit sword's allegiance
achievement.flammpfeil.slashblade.phantomBlade=phantomBlade
achievement.flammpfeil.slashblade.phantomBlade.desc=Designed to pursue living beings§8§l§oToggle by striking with Soul Sphere

achievement.silverlighting.wrap.BalkonWood.desc=A wooden katana sheathed. Using the sheath's power, it becomes a vessel for iaido
achievement.silverlighting.wrap.BalkonStone.desc=A stone katana sheathed. Possesses a stronger blade body, bearing greater power
achievement.silverlighting.wrap.BalkonIron.desc=An iron katana sheathed. Already sharp, now even better at slaying enemies
achievement.silverlighting.wrap.BalkonGold.desc=A golden katana sheathed. Loses strong blade body but gains more unique power
achievement.silverlighting.wrap.BalkonDiamond.desc=A diamond katana sheathed. This unbreakable blade will show you what iaido truly is

